      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It has taken me so long to write all this down. It was a love story when I started, of sorts anyway, of love for Alexand",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 711
        },
        {
          "text": "Some days I wake and feel that still, that pulsing inside me that I know is a yearning for him, an everlasting, enduring",
