        {
          "text": "he very much haunts me, but only his memory, a large presence stomping through the halls of my mind",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1333
        },
        {
          "text": "I have gone to his room and dug through his belongings, read pages upon pages of books I could not half understand. Neve",
          "ok": true,
