      ],
      "words": 56
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "A handful of years after Alexander’s passing, I brought a priest in – not the local pastor but someone from the city – a",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2758
        },
        {
          "text": "Two months after that, I walked the house while burning sage",
          "ok": true,
