        {
          "text": "and had old furniture, rotting in place by then, carted away and burned in a big bonfire in the fields",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3254
        }
      ],
      "words": 62
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Nick did talk to me, before the slow unravelling of our strange trio",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3939
        },
        {
          "text": "He knocked, so softly I barely heard it, and entered without waiting for an invitation. I shivered, as he stood there by",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4267
        }
      ],
      "words": 53
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "‘I think you’ll find, Isabel, that we both care for Alexander very much,’ he said",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5579
        },
        {
          "text": "I imagined taking the fire poker and driving it through his head. The image was quick and vicious, and gone swiftly. Sti",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6073
        }
      ],
      "words": 46
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "‘By the way, your husband has tasked me with finding your father.’",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6674
        },
        {
          "text": "There was more in that one sentence than I could process at once",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6739
        },
        {
